# was unexpectedly the single most useful source). None could reach nuklearesicherheit.de, gracesguide,
# or IAEA PRIS reactor-detail pages (PRIS uses ASP.NET postback links unreachable via direct WebFetch).
# Turbine_supplier is the single weakest field across this entire batch — UNVERIFIABLE for the large
# majority of KWU-era plants, since Wikipedia articles typically conflate turbine supply under the
